Semgrep commands no longer fail at startup when the installed `mcp`
package is version 2.x. The CLI used to import the MCP server module
at startup, which pulls in `mcp.server.fastmcp`, a module that raises
`ModuleNotFoundError` under mcp 2.x. The MCP server module is now
imported lazily, so only `semgrep mcp` itself needs the MCP SDK.
